{"id":"8271","name":"RH.fun","address":null,"symbol":"-","url":"","description":"RH.fun is a bonding-curve token launchpad on Robinhood Chain. Anyone can launch a token in seconds; tokens graduate to Uniswap V2 once the curve target is reached. Supports ETH and USDG markets","chain":"Robinhood Chain","logo":"https://icons.llamao.fi/icons/protocols/rh.fun","audits":"0","gecko_id":null,"cmcId":null,"category":"Launchpad","chains":["Robinhood Chain"],"module":"rhfun/index.js","twitter":"RHdotfun","github":["rhdotfun"],"listedAt":1784827017,"dimensions":{"fees":"rhfun","dexs":"rhfun"},"methodology":"Counts collateral held by RH.fun market contracts on Robinhood Chain, enumerated from factory events: ETH/USDG in un-graduated bonding-curve clones (NewRHTokenCurveParams), quote-token tax accrued on per-token TaxProcessor and Dividend clones (NewRHTaxTokenParams), and native balances of market vaults (MarketVaultCreated). When a curve graduates, its liquidity migrates to the chain's Uniswap V2 DEX and the curve is drained to zero in the same transaction, so graduated liquidity is no longer counted here. Locked allocations of launched tokens themselves are excluded.","tvlCodePath":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/DefiLlama-Adapters/blob/main/projects/rhfun/index.js","chainTvls":{"Robinhood Chain":{"tvl":[{"date":1784764800,"totalLiquidityUSD":1501},{"date":1784851200,"totalLiquidityUSD":1470},{"date":1784937600,"totalLiquidityUSD":1395},{"date":1785024000,"totalLiquidityUSD":1404},{"date":1785110400,"totalLiquidityUSD":1473},{"date":1785196800,"totalLiquidityUSD":1539},{"date":1785283200,"totalLiquidityUSD":1444},{"date":1785369600,"totalLiquidityUSD":1279},{"date":1785456000,"totalLiquidityUSD":1349},{"date":1785542400,"totalLiquidityUSD":1318},{"date":1785628800,"totalLiquidityUSD":1309},{"date":1785715200,"totalLiquidityUSD":1345},{"date":1785801600,"totalLiquidityUSD":1318},{"date":1785888000,"totalLiquidityUSD":1270},{"date":1785974400,"totalLiquidityUSD":1298},{"date":178